    "text": "<p>The magnetic moment,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>&#8203;</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></msqrt><mo>&#8203;</mo><mi>BM</mi></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> is the number of unpaired electrons.&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Cr</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>Ar</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>24</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>89</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>BM</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>Ar</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>35</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>91</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>BM</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mrow><mo